    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Designed with the same principals as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mesh_Armor\" title=\"Mesh Armor\">Mesh Armor</a>, the Mesh Underlay Armor Accessory helps channel certain types of energy away from the wearer's body, reducing the effectiveness of a potentially devastating blow. A character wearing a suit of Armor with the Mesh Underlay Armor Accessory gains a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a> against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> damage. </p>",
